Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 15
Author: Warren Neale
Date: 1925-02-07
Byline: The above Puzzle was contributed by Warren Neale, 2767 Morris avenue, New York City.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1925-02-07_88/page/n34/mode/1up
Number: 15
